--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-035.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# BP-035 — Client state and renderer handoff
+
+- Aligns dynamic-light allocation, expiry and decay with `cl_main.c`.
+- Applies explicit Binary32 storage at client interpolation boundaries.
+- Preserves first-person/chase visibility rules and the `MAX_VISEDICTS` cap.
+- Adds a defensive active-visible view and explicit view-entity origin handoff.
+- Adds 20 MiniLang runtime fixtures and an independent C oracle.
diff --git a/CHANGELOG_BP-036.md b/CHANGELOG_BP-036.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..651e6277b8c4877ead17ff92e2eddfea3e582ae8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-036.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# BP-036 — View state and chase camera
+
+- Uses Quake `atoi` semantics for `v_cshift` command arguments.
+- Adds a refdef-aware chase-camera update matching `chase.c`.
+- Replaces only chase pitch while preserving rendered yaw and roll.
+- Keeps the traced chase destination and view-vector recomputation explicit.
+- Adds 22 MiniLang runtime fixtures and an independent C oracle.
diff --git a/CHANGELOG_BP-037.md b/CHANGELOG_BP-037.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ec104ffb819fb3e449524aaa0e9dce3cc2081c96
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-037.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# BP-037 — Temporary beam model entities
+
+- Builds `CL_UpdateTEnts`-style temporary alias entities for beams.
+- Maps the four beam types to `bolt.mdl`, `bolt2.mdl`, `bolt3.mdl` and `beam.mdl`.
+- Emits 30-unit segments with original-style random roll.
+- Uses the current view-entity origin for player-owned beams.
+- Enforces both `MAX_TEMP_ENTITIES` and `MAX_VISEDICTS`.
+- Adds 22 MiniLang runtime fixtures and an independent C oracle.
diff --git a/CHANGELOG_BP-038.md b/CHANGELOG_BP-038.md
new file mode 100644
